Alembic migration scripts for the Solar Forge Boards PostgreSQL schema.

The version files in versions/ are the ordered production schema history. Update
backend/app/models.py first, generate and inspect a revision, and commit both changes together.
Apply the current schema with:

    uv run alembic upgrade head

Do not edit a revision that has already been applied to a shared database. Add a new revision
instead, and preserve existing project and story data unless a destructive migration is explicitly
required. See ../../docs/development.md for the complete local and Docker migration workflows.
